@host = http://localhost:5081

### Create one forecast
POST {{host}}/forecasts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-14", "temperatureC": 21, "summary": "Mild", "city": "Natal" }

### Create several in one round-trip
POST {{host}}/forecasts/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "date": "2026-10-15", "temperatureC": 28, "summary": "Hot", "city": "Natal" },
  { "date": "2026-10-16", "temperatureC": 17, "summary": "Cool", "city": "Curitiba" }
]

### Stream every forecast
GET {{host}}/forecasts
Accept: application/json

### One page, newest first
GET {{host}}/forecasts/page?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### A projection rather than whole documents
GET {{host}}/forecasts/summaries
Accept: application/json

### Distinct cities
GET {{host}}/forecasts/cities
Accept: application/json

### Partial update: one field, no document resend
PATCH {{host}}/forecasts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/temperature?temperatureC=30

### Reassign a city inside a transaction
POST {{host}}/forecasts/move-city?fromCity=Natal&toCity=Recife
